# The Rise of Sozin, all three chapters (CR 714): "I - Destroy all creatures. II - Choose a card name. Search target opponent's
# graveyard, hand, and library for up to four cards with that name and exile them. Then that player shuffles. III - Exile this
# Saga, then return it to the battlefield transformed under your control."
#
# Bot2 casts two Llanowar Elves and an Ornithopter on T2 and keeps a third Elves in hand. Cast on T3, the Saga's chapter I
# destroys every creature, Bot1's own Ornithopter as well as Bot2's three (Black Lotus, an artifact that is no creature, was
# sacrificed). On T5 chapter II targets Bot2 and Bot1 names Llanowar Elves as it resolves: the two in the graveyard, the one in
# hand and one of the two in the library are four, the limit, and the other stays in the library, which is shuffled. On T7
# chapter III exiles the Saga and returns it transformed: Fire Lord Sozin, a legendary 5/5 black Human Noble with menace, a new
# object that has just come under Bot1's control (summoning sick).

